@startuml data-flow-sequence
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center

title **Ariel System — Low-Latency Request & Durable Event Processing Flow**

actor "Client" as Client
participant "Edge Gateway\n(Spring Cloud Gateway)" as Gateway #93C5FD
participant "Ingestion Service\n(Java 25 Virtual Threads)" as Ingestion #BFDBFE
database "L1/L2 Cache\n(Caffeine + Redis)" as Cache #FCD34D
participant "Risk Engine\n(Structured Concurrency)" as Risk #BFDBFE
participant "Ledger Service\n(Spring Boot 4.1.2)" as Ledger #BFDBFE
database "PostgreSQL 17\n(Write + Outbox)" as DB #A7F3D0
queue "Apache Kafka\n(KRaft Cluster)" as Kafka #F9A8D4
participant "Stream Processor\n(Kafka Streams)" as Stream #BFDBFE
database "ScyllaDB + ClickHouse\n(Read & OLAP Stores)" as OLAP #34D399

== Phase 1: Ultra-Low Latency Synchronous Ingestion & Validation (< 15ms P99) ==

Client -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/events (Idempotency-Key, Payload)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Cache : Check Rate Limit & JWT Blacklist (Redis Lua Script)
Cache --> Gateway : Allowed (0.4ms)

Gateway -> Ingestion : Forward Request (gRPC / HTTP2 + TraceContext)
activate Ingestion

Ingestion -> Cache : GET Idempotency-Key (L1 -> L2 Redis)
alt Duplicate Request Detected
    Cache --> Ingestion : Cached Response Payload
    Ingestion --> Gateway : 200 OK (Idempotent Replay)
    Gateway --> Client : 200 OK
else New Request
    Cache --> Ingestion : Cache Miss (Lock Acquired with TTL)
    
    Ingestion -> Risk : Evaluate Risk & Routing (gRPC)
    activate Risk
    note right of Risk
      Uses **Java 25 StructuredTaskScope**
      to fan-out parallel checks:
      1. Velocity check (Redis)
      2. Rule evaluation (L1 Caffeine)
      3. Anomaly score
    end note
    Risk -> Cache : MGET Velocity Counters & Rules
    Cache --> Risk : Feature Vector (0.8ms)
    Risk --> Ingestion : RiskDecision(APPROVED, score=0.02)
    deactivate Risk

    Ingestion -> Ledger : RecordCommand(TransactionPayload)
    activate Ledger
    Ledger -> DB : BEGIN TX\n1. INSERT INTO ledger_entries\n2. INSERT INTO outbox_events\nCOMMIT TX
    DB --> Ledger : Committed
    Ledger --> Ingestion : Ack (TxID)
    deactivate Ledger

    Ingestion -> Cache : SET Idempotency-Key = Result (TTL 24h)
    Ingestion --> Gateway : 202 Accepted / 200 OK (TxID)
    deactivate Ingestion
    Gateway --> Client : 202 Accepted (TxID)
    deactivate Gateway
end

== Phase 2: Asynchronous Durable Event Streaming & Large Data Handling ==

DB -> Kafka : Outbox Relay / Debezium CDC publishes\nAvro Event to `ariel.transactions.validated`
activate Kafka

Kafka -> Stream : Consume Batch (Virtual Thread / Consumer Group)
activate Stream

par Parallel Polyglot Sink Writes
    Stream -> OLAP : Async Batch Insert into ScyllaDB (Time-Series Log)
else
    Stream -> OLAP : Micro-Batch Append into ClickHouse (Real-Time Analytics)
else
    Stream -> Cache : Update Materialized View & Rolling Aggregations in Redis
end

alt Downstream Sink Transient Failure
    Stream -> Stream : Exponential Backoff Retry (Resilience4j)
else Poison Pill / Unrecoverable Failure
    Stream -> Kafka : Publish to `ariel.dlq` with Error Headers & Alert OTel
end

deactivate Stream
deactivate Kafka

@enduml
